# Editor and OS noise.
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Runtime output. Everything this plugin generates is written to ~/.config,
# ~/.local/state and ~/.cache at run time, never into its own directory -- the
# only paths it writes are absolute ones derived from $HOME. These patterns exist
# so that if a future handler ever does write a relative path, an accidental
# `git add .` does not commit a machine's palette.
*.log
*.bak